## Cook County Municipalities

```{r}
library(leaflet)
library(sf)
library(here)

muni <- read_sf(here("shapefiles", "Municipality.geojson")) %>%
  st_transform(crs = 4326)

leaflet() %>%
  addTiles() %>%
  addPolygons(
    data = muni,
    color = "black",
    weight = 2,
    opacity = 0.4,
    fillOpacity = 0,
    label = muni$MUNICIPALITY
  ) %>%
  setView(lat = 41.85003, lng = -87.65005, zoom = 10)

```

## Goals of SDOP

-   Go beyond the crimogenic needs and identify barriers that are individual and systemic

-   Leverage a cross systems, multidsicplenary approach

-   Improve the chances of succes for our youth and families

## How we're going to do that

-   

-   Work with community partners

-   Develop case plans based on common ground goals

-   Progress, not perfection

